  _lines:
  - Speaker: Mentor
    Text: You can move the camera using the right stick or WASD. You can zoom in
      and out with the triggers or the QE keys
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: 
    RightName: Mentor
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6358ec34be7e5e149b95f25afd6fe2a3, type: 3}
  - Speaker: Mentor
    Text: To select a unit you can toggle with the bumpers or left click on the unit
      you want to select.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: 
    RightName: Mentor
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6358ec34be7e5e149b95f25afd6fe2a3, type: 3}
  - Speaker: Mentor
    Text: To move the unit you have selected move the cursor to location you want
      it to move to and hit the A button the gamepad or right click. If you have
      the cursor on enemy unit then you will be ordering your unit to attack it.
    WordsPerMinute: 0
    SpeakerSide: 2
    LeftName: 
    RightName: Mentor
    LeftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    RightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6358ec34be7e5e149b95f25afd6fe2a3, type: 3}
